        "title": "Pocket Science Lab - GSoC '18",
        "short_description": "Pocket Science Lab by FOSSASIA is a electronic measurement and analytical tool. This helps students, teachers, undergraduates and hobbyists in...",
        "description": "<p><strong>Pocket Science Lab</strong> by FOSSASIA is a electronic measurement and analytical tool. This helps students, teachers, undergraduates and hobbyists in numerous ways in their academics as well as projects.</p>\n<p>The project currently facilitates PSLab interfaces with <em>Android</em> and <em>Desktop</em> platforms. Desktop application is rather complete but the Android application is not. Both the applications need improvements more or less. The expected outcome by the end of this summer is to make these platforms fully functional with ease of use. Apart from these platforms, a <em>Web</em> interface will also be developed.</p>\n<p>These three complete platforms will increase the usability of <strong>PSLab</strong> device over almost any systems, be it Windows, Linux, Mac or Android. User will not have to spend hundreds of dollars on costly equipments to help with their projects and practicals anymore.</p>\n",
        "student_name": "Madhushanka Padmal",
        "code_url": "https://gist.github.com/CloudyPadmal/77e08e68b84d7e44bcc5d6bdf5e47cfc",
        "project_url": "https://summerofcode.withgoogle.com/archive/2018/projects/6235280579231744/"
      },
      {
        "title": "Upgrading the PSLab Android Application",
        "short_description": "PSLab (Pocket Science Lab) is an Open Source hardware device (open on all layers). The Android App for PSLab aims to run PSLab device in android...",
        "description": "<p>PSLab (Pocket Science Lab) is an Open Source hardware device (open on all layers). The Android App for PSLab aims to run PSLab device in android smartphones.This proposal offers to upgrade PSLab Android App by implementing all the leftover functionalities in the Android App.</p>\n",
        "student_name": "Abhinav Raj",
        "code_url": "https://gist.github.com/abhinavraj23/3ddcca55622ce30499d8c0ad25a64929",
        "project_url": "https://summerofcode.withgoogle.com/archive/2018/projects/5852826425098240/"
      }
    ]
  },
